{'symbol': 'VZ', 'date': '2022-10-28 15:07:00', 'title': 'NEXSTAR AND VERIZON FIOS REACH MULTI-YEAR DISTRIBUTION AGREEMENT', 'text': "IRVING, TEXAS & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NEXSTAR MEDIA GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: NXST) (“NEXSTAR”), AND VERIZON FIOS (NYSE: VZ) (“VERIZON”) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY HAVE REACHED A COMPREHENSIVE MULTI-YEAR DISTRIBUTION AGREEMENT REGARDING LOCAL TELEVISION STATIONS IN 10 MARKETS AND NEXSTAR'S FAST-GROWING NATIONAL CABLE NEWS NETWORK, NEWSNATION."}